WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
Welcome to MX Terminal.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.880
Every African market, one terminal.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:12.990
Sign in with Google, or create an account with your email and a password of at least eight characters.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.824
This is the board.

00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:24.308
One thousand and twenty five listed companies across Johannesburg, Lagos, Nairobi and Cairo, priced at the last close.

00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:30.874
The tape runs along the top: the index level, then every security and its move on the day.

00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:33.760
On the left, the watchlist.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.296
Every company on that market.

00:00:36.296 --> 00:00:38.832
Click a name to load it.

00:00:39.182 --> 00:00:46.814
On the right, the session at a glance: advances and declines, top gainers, top losers, most active.

00:00:47.164 --> 00:00:51.212
It is keyboard first.

00:00:51.212 --> 00:00:55.260
Type a ticker, a panel code, or an exchange.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:59.308
M T N, space, F I N, opens MTN's financials.

00:00:59.658 --> 00:01:02.742
Heatmap.

00:01:02.742 --> 00:01:05.826
Every sector, sized by weight, coloured by the day's move.

00:01:06.176 --> 00:01:11.000
Financials.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.824
Income statement, balance sheet and cash flow, straight from company filings, with the ratios worked out.

00:01:16.174 --> 00:01:19.262
News.

00:01:19.262 --> 00:01:22.350
Press headlines, the regulator wire, dividends and book closures.

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.438
One wire per market.

00:01:25.788 --> 00:01:30.840
The screener filters and exports.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:35.892
Beside it sit commodities, bonds, foreign exchange, time and sales, and ratings.

00:01:36.242 --> 00:01:39.014
The written guide is on the site.

00:01:39.014 --> 00:01:41.786
Click Guide in the top navigation.

00:01:42.136 --> 00:01:45.976
Every panel code and every shortcut is listed there.

00:01:46.326 --> 00:01:49.026
MX Terminal.

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:51.726
Every African market, one terminal.

